---
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
import { investmentSupport } from '../../data/content';
---
<section class="investment-section section-pad" id="investment" aria-labelledby="investment-title"><div class="wrapper investment-grid"><div class="investment-copy"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Investment &amp; company establishment</p><h2 id="investment-title">A considered way<br />to <em>build in Indonesia.</em></h2><p>From exploring an opportunity to establishing a PT PMA (foreign investment company), our role is to coordinate the right steps and conversations around your goals.</p><Button href="#contact" variant="gold">Consultation details</Button><div class="investment-caption"><span>BUSINESS</span><span>INVESTMENT</span><span>PARTNERSHIP</span></div></div><div class="investment-list"><div class="investment-list-heading"><span>SUPPORT AREAS</span><span>01 / 06</span></div>{investmentSupport.map((item, index) => <div class="investment-item"><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><h3>{item}</h3><Icon name="check" size={20} /></div>)}<p>Legal, tax, licensing and financial decisions should be reviewed with qualified professionals. Investment opportunities require independent due diligence.</p></div></div></section>
